      "score": 5,
      "justification": "Coverage is extensive: accounts, groups, transactions, transfers, splits, categories, payees, rules, schedules, budgets, tags, notes, preferences, bank sync, export/import, search and session management. Lifecycle operations (create, read, update, delete, batch, merge) exist for nearly every entity, leaving few dead ends."
    }
